{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはなーこ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN28SCX3GYRQEQP6RFS7F36","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN28VWT2XCJ59PR87D86GZ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人をダメにするクッションというクッションが欲しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構大きいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1度そのクッションに入ると、1日終了が終了してしまうらしい･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、絵を描く時に使ってる道具を載せます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから集めていきたいなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"修正液、カッター、ペン先、ペン軸"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN28YW6QZSG5JK2DX7P4QET","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を書く時に使ってた原稿用紙"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN290AAD57X0SKN91Y8PADY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクリーントーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN291VZDED9P376FBS6WS2D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生の時のものなので年期が入ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、集めていた時が、小学生だったこともあって使えるお金がなくてあまり集められなかったのでこれからちょっとずつ貯めていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のブログに載っけた、コピックも小学生の時に集めたものです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから少しずつ描いていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペン入れ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2938XW2MMK05K93ZMXRCV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落書き。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN29507FQMXQ6KGY9WF1A6S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nマネキン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女漫画だいすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画家の池山田剛さんの漫画を読むことにハマっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー。たくさん読みたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"育てていた植物が、イタリアンパセリだと発覚しました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN296FQ3MV6EV1052E6YF4V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観察日記3日目、変化なし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てこいやあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}